  - m_Id: 3001745490423811
    m_Localized: Master of the One-Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3001745490423812
    m_Localized: 'You are a master of the One Strike.


      As a melee weapon-based
      class, you sweep through enemies using the powerful charge skill, ''One Strike''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699647782912
    m_Localized: blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699710697472
    m_Localized: blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699710697473
    m_Localized: 'When performing a basic attack with a melee weapon, you charge
      forward while rapidly slashing.


      Basic attack damage for melee weapons
      becomes 400%.


      You must fill the ''One-Shot'' gauge after using an attack
      to attack again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699710697474
    m_Localized: One-Shot' gauge is gained at a rate of 3% per second while moving
      and 5% when hitting an enemy with a basic attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699710697475
    m_Localized: quick feet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699714891776
    m_Localized: Movement speed increases by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699714891778
    m_Localized: Catch your breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699714891779
    m_Localized: Instantly fills the One-Hit Gauge by 50%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699714891780
    m_Localized: Master of the One-Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699714891781
    m_Localized: 'When used, you enter the ''Master of One-Hit'' state for 8 seconds.


      The
      amount of ''One-Hit'' gauge gained from movement and basic attack hits is increased
      to 300%.


      While in the ''Master of One-Hit'' state, hitting with ''One-Hit''
      instantly fills the ''One-Hit'' gauge to 100%.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3004699714891782
    m_Localized: Movement speed increases by 2 during the duration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
