    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837762
    m_Localized: Inflicts <color=orange>Burn</color> on the target for {d0} seconds,
      dealing fixed damage equal to {v0}% of maximum health every second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837763
    m_Localized: statue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837764
    m_Localized: Inflicts the target's <color=sky>frost</color> effect for {d0} seconds,
      reducing their attack speed by {v1}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837765
    m_Localized: judgment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5227191342837766
    m_Localized: When hitting, deals additional <b>fixed damage equal to {v0}% of
